# Keep the build context small and keep secrets / host-built artefacts out of image layers.
# (Without this, `COPY . .` overwrites the container's node_modules with the host's, e.g. macOS/Windows binaries.)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
*.zip
